<title>FRANCE: France Telecom selloff next Spring - Arthuis.</title>
<headline>France Telecom selloff next Spring - Arthuis.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>France expects the privatisation of France Telecom to take place next Spring, Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;It's due for Spring and I hope it will prove very popular,&quot; Arthuis told France 2 television.</p>
<p>France Telecom chairman Michel Bon said in business daily Les Echos on Monday he expected the state-owned telecommunications group to list shares on the Paris bourse in mid-April 1997.</p>
